    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mandated Fate",
    "steam_appid": 3599830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mandated Fate</strong>\u00a0is dark retro-futuristic story-driven game where you play as a weary inspector, a man out of place in a newly established authoritarian regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1985, a technological empire seized power, driven by an ultimate goal: discovering the anti-gravity particle to conquer space. Yet, one old district resists\u2014no one seems to know how. As an inspector, you are sent to investigate a strange murder in this outcast place. Through five narrative paths, your choices will shape your loyalty to those you deem worthy of your trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a highly detailed open world, where the striking contrast between modern authoritarian architecture and remnants of the past tells a story of its own. Find your path between your own values and the oppressive ideals of this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face truly critical choices from the very beginning\u2014decisions that will have a significant impact on the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly detailed open world with numerous explorable building interiors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and complex dialogues that shape interactions and outcomes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark and captivating atmosphere inspired by neo-noir and cyberpunk aesthetics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully functional subway system integrated into the game world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mandated Fate</strong>\u00a0is dark retro-futuristic story-driven game where you play as a weary inspector, a man out of place in a newly established authoritarian regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1985, a technological empire seized power, driven by an ultimate goal: discovering the anti-gravity particle to conquer space. Yet, one old district resists\u2014no one seems to know how. As an inspector, you are sent to investigate a strange murder in this outcast place. Through five narrative paths, your choices will shape your loyalty to those you deem worthy of your trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a highly detailed open world, where the striking contrast between modern authoritarian architecture and remnants of the past tells a story of its own. Find your path between your own values and the oppressive ideals of this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face truly critical choices from the very beginning\u2014decisions that will have a significant impact on the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly detailed open world with numerous explorable building interiors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and complex dialogues that shape interactions and outcomes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark and captivating atmosphere inspired by neo-noir and cyberpunk aesthetics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully functional subway system integrated into the game world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Enter a dark open world ruled by a technocratic Empire. A retro-sci-fi setting full of secrets and geopolitical tensions, all wrapped in a gloomy, towering atmosphere. As an Imperial Police inspector sent to investigate: make moral choices, play factions against each other, expose or hide the truth.",
